# Python 3.14 LL grammar: files, statements, suites, expressions.
# Requires indentation_syntax=true, newline_after_block_end=true.
#
# Covers: imports (dotted, as-lists, from-lists, relative dots),
# type aliases with type params, match/case with as-patterns and guards,
# def (annotated/default/star params, returns), async def, decorators,
# class with call-style bases, comprehensions (incl. async for),
# generators, slices, walrus, yield/yield-from, f/t-strings (balanced
# braces, nested strings), full operator precedence, elif/else,
# while/for-else, with-items, try/except/except*/else/finally,
# assert/raise/del with tails, global/nonlocal, tuple/star/annotated/
# chained/augmented/attribute/subscript assignment, kwargs/stars in calls.
#
# Accepted limitations (Black-style input assumed):
# - Blank lines anywhere (including unindented blanks inside blocks)
#   are skipped by the indentation lexer; this needs a galley runtime
#   with blank-line skipping (present in the current working tree).
#   Blank lines between top-level statements were always fine.
# - Spaces only for indentation and single spaces around infix and word
#   operators (`x  +  y` with doubled spaces fails; `x+1` works).
# - No trailing space before closers; no space before `,`/`:`.
# - Full-line `#` comments work (top level and indented); trailing
#   `x = 1 # comment` does not. No explicit `\` line continuation;
#   no `;` statement separators; no one-line suites
#   (`if x: pass` needs a block).
# - Soft keywords match/case/type act as hard keywords except for
#   tight `name=value` form (`match=1` works, `match = 1` does not).
# - f/t-string interpolation is structural (balanced braces, nested
#   strings, opaque `!`/`:`/`=` tails); triple-quoted f/t-strings stay
#   opaque (no nesting); `{` always opens interpolation while a stray
#   `}` reads as a literal (so `f"}"` is accepted).
# - Bare conditionals need parens in case patterns, else branches,
#   lambda bodies and yield-from operands (`a if b else (c if d else e)`,
#   `lambda: (x if y else z)`); walrus right-hand sides take
#   `Disjunction` only (`x := (a if b else c)`).
# - Do not name variables exactly `yield` (`yield = 5` fails).
# - `0.`-style floats need the trailing digit (`0.0`); identifiers
#   are ASCII letters/digits/`_` (no PEP 3131 names); strings accept
#   full UTF-8 (validated scalars, same shapes as json-unicode);
#   `**` dict unpacking and trailing commas work in displays but
#   `{*x}` set-unpacking does not.
# - Comprehension targets are bare names (`k, v` works; `(k, v)`,
#   `*rest`, attribute targets do not); def/class take no type params,
#   no `/` or bare-`*` markers; `global`/`nonlocal` take single names.
# - `match` patterns accept an expression superset (e.g. `case a + b:`
#   parses though invalid); `except (A, B)` tuples work; `from` import
#   lists take parens but no trailing commas; relative imports allow
#   up to `...`; `with (a as b):` needs the parens dropped.
# - Adjacent string literal concatenation (`"a" "b"`, including across
#   lines) is not folded: any blank-separated optional continuation
#   collides with downstream blanks in the LL(1) table. Write one
#   string per expression or use explicit `+`.
# - After* fallthroughs: a keyword-prefixed name continues as a full
#   expression statement (`input(x)`, `notx == 1`).
# Tab is "\u{9}".

Start
| File

File@flattenLists
| _FileLead Statements _FileTail
| _FileLead

_FileLead
| new_line _FileLead
|

_FileTail
| block_end _FileTail
|

# Statements
#
# Every statement kind is its own node, listed flat under File or Block.
# Keywords carry their delimiter ("if ", "else:"), so an identifier that
# merely starts with a keyword ("iffy", "matched") lexes as a Name through
# longest-match. Only keywords that can stand alone (return, pass, break,
# continue, raise) need a fallback for such identifiers; identifierStatement
# turns that fallback into an ExpressionStatement.
#
# Clauses (elif, else, except, finally) are sibling statements: a dedent is
# followed by the control byte that new_line matches, so the statement list
# always continues before a clause could attach to its compound statement.

Statements
| Comment
| Comment _StatementEnd
| Comment _StatementEnd Statements
| If
| If _StatementEnd
| If _StatementEnd Statements
| Elif
| Elif _StatementEnd
| Elif _StatementEnd Statements
| Else
| Else _StatementEnd
| Else _StatementEnd Statements
| While
| While _StatementEnd
| While _StatementEnd Statements
| For
| For _StatementEnd
| For _StatementEnd Statements
| With
| With _StatementEnd
| With _StatementEnd Statements
| Try
| Try _StatementEnd
| Try _StatementEnd Statements
| Except
| Except _StatementEnd
| Except _StatementEnd Statements
| Finally
| Finally _StatementEnd
| Finally _StatementEnd Statements
| Return
| Return _StatementEnd
| Return _StatementEnd Statements
| Raise
| Raise _StatementEnd
| Raise _StatementEnd Statements
| Assert
| Assert _StatementEnd
| Assert _StatementEnd Statements
| Delete
| Delete _StatementEnd
| Delete _StatementEnd Statements
| Global
| Global _StatementEnd
| Global _StatementEnd Statements
| Nonlocal
| Nonlocal _StatementEnd
| Nonlocal _StatementEnd Statements
| Import
| Import _StatementEnd
| Import _StatementEnd Statements
| ImportFrom
| ImportFrom _StatementEnd
| ImportFrom _StatementEnd Statements
| ClassDefinition
| ClassDefinition _StatementEnd
| ClassDefinition _StatementEnd Statements
| FunctionDefinition
| FunctionDefinition _StatementEnd
| FunctionDefinition _StatementEnd Statements
| Decorated
| Decorated _StatementEnd
| Decorated _StatementEnd Statements
| Pass
| Pass _StatementEnd
| Pass _StatementEnd Statements
| Break
| Break _StatementEnd
| Break _StatementEnd Statements
| Continue
| Continue _StatementEnd
| Continue _StatementEnd Statements
| Match
| Match _StatementEnd
| Match _StatementEnd Statements
| Case
| Case _StatementEnd
| Case _StatementEnd Statements
| TypeAlias
| TypeAlias _StatementEnd
| TypeAlias _StatementEnd Statements
| ExpressionStatement
| ExpressionStatement _StatementEnd
| ExpressionStatement _StatementEnd Statements

_StatementEnd
| _TrailComment new_line _BlankLines

_BlankLines
| new_line _BlankLines
|

_TrailComment
| "#"@>^"\n"
| " #"@>^"\n"
| "  #"@>^"\n"
|

Block@flattenLists
| _TrailComment block_start Statements block_end

Comment
| "#"@>^"\n"

If@countIf
| "if " _OptBlank Expression ":" Block
| "if(" _OptBlank Expression ")" ":" Block

Elif@countIf
| "elif " _OptBlank Expression ":" Block
| "elif(" _OptBlank Expression ")" ":" Block

Else@countIf
| "else:" Block
| "else " _OptBlank ":" Block

While@countLoop
| "while " _OptBlank Expression ":" Block
| "while(" _OptBlank Expression ")" ":" Block

For@flattenLists@countLoop
| "for " _OptBlank ForTargets
| "async for " _OptBlank ForTargets

ForTargets
| Name "," _OptBlank ForTargets
| Name " in" _OptBlank Expression ":" Block

With@flattenLists@countWith
| "with " _OptBlank WithItems
| "async with " _OptBlank WithItems

WithItems
| Expression ":" Block
| Expression "," _OptBlank WithItems
| Expression AsName ":" Block
| Expression AsName "," _OptBlank WithItems

AsName
| " as" _OptBlank Name

Try@countTry
| "try:" Block
| "try " _OptBlank ":" Block

Except@countTry
| "except:" Block
| "except " _OptBlank ":" Block
| "except " _OptBlank Expression ":" Block
| "except " _OptBlank Expression AsName ":" Block
| "except*" _OptBlank Expression ":" Block
| "except*" _OptBlank Expression AsName ":" Block

Finally@countTry
| "finally:" Block
| "finally " _OptBlank ":" Block

Return@flattenLists@identifierStatement
| "return"
| "return" space _OptBlank
| "return" space _OptBlank Expression
| "return" space _OptBlank Expression "," _OptBlank ExpressionList
| "return" space _OptBlank Starred
| "return" space _OptBlank Starred "," _OptBlank ExpressionList
| "return" Parenthesized
| "return" KeywordStatement

Raise@flattenLists@identifierStatement
| "raise"
| "raise" space _OptBlank
| "raise" space _OptBlank Expression
| "raise" space _OptBlank Expression RaiseFrom
| "raise" Parenthesized
| "raise" KeywordStatement

RaiseFrom
| " from" _OptBlank Expression

Assert
| "assert " _OptBlank Expression
| "assert " _OptBlank Expression "," _OptBlank Expression

Delete@flattenLists
| "del " _OptBlank ExpressionList

Global
| "global " _OptBlank Name

Nonlocal
| "nonlocal " _OptBlank Name

Import@flattenLists@countImport
| "import " _OptBlank ImportNames

ImportNames
| DottedName
| DottedName "," _OptBlank ImportNames
| DottedName AsName
| DottedName AsName "," _OptBlank ImportNames

DottedName
| _IdStart _IdTail _DottedRest

_DottedRest
| "." _IdStart _IdTail _DottedRest
|

ImportFrom@flattenLists@countImport
| "from " _OptBlank ModuleName " import" _OptBlank "*"
| "from " _OptBlank ModuleName " import" _OptBlank FromNames
| "from " _OptBlank ModuleName " import" _OptBlank "(" _InsideBlank ParenthesizedFromNames

ModuleName
| _IdStart _IdTail _DottedRest
| "." _RelativeModule

_RelativeModule
| "." _RelativeModule
| _IdStart _IdTail _DottedRest
|

FromNames
| Name
| Name "," _OptBlank FromNames
| Name AsName
| Name AsName "," _OptBlank FromNames

ParenthesizedFromNames
| Name _InsideBlank ")"
| Name "," _InsideBlank ")"
| Name "," _InsideBlank ParenthesizedFromNames
| Name AsName _InsideBlank ")"
| Name AsName "," _InsideBlank ")"
| Name AsName "," _InsideBlank ParenthesizedFromNames

ClassDefinition@countClass
| "class " _OptBlank Name ":" Block
| "class " _OptBlank Name Call ":" Block

FunctionDefinition@flattenLists@countFunction
| "def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank ")" ":" Block
| "def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank ")" ReturnAnnotation ":" Block
| "def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank Parameters
| "async def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank ")" ":" Block
| "async def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank ")" ReturnAnnotation ":" Block
| "async def " _OptBlank Name "(" _InsideBlank Parameters

Parameters
| Parameter ")" ":" Block
| Parameter ")" ReturnAnnotation ":" Block
| Parameter "," _InsideBlank ")" ":" Block
| Parameter "," _InsideBlank ")" ReturnAnnotation ":" Block
| Parameter "," _InsideBlank Parameters

Parameter
| Name
| Name Annotation
| Name Annotation Default
| Name Default
| "*" _OptBlank Name
| "*" _OptBlank Name Annotation
| "**" _OptBlank Name
| "**" _OptBlank Name Annotation

Annotation
| ":" _OptBlank Expression

Default
| "=" _OptBlank Expression
| " =" _OptBlank Expression

ReturnAnnotation
| "->" _OptBlank Expression
| " ->" _OptBlank Expression

Decorated@rightRecursiveReduction
| "@" _OptBlank Expression _TrailComment new_line Decorated
| "@" _OptBlank Expression _TrailComment new_line FunctionDefinition
| "@" _OptBlank Expression _TrailComment new_line ClassDefinition

Pass@flattenLists@identifierStatement
| "pass"
| "pass" space _OptBlank
| "pass" KeywordStatement

Break@flattenLists@identifierStatement
| "break"
| "break" space _OptBlank
| "break" KeywordStatement

Continue@flattenLists@identifierStatement
| "continue"
| "continue" space _OptBlank
| "continue" KeywordStatement

Match@countMatch
| "match " _OptBlank Expression ":" Block

Case@countCase
| "case " _OptBlank Disjunction ":" Block
| "case " _OptBlank Disjunction AsName ":" Block
| "case " _OptBlank Disjunction Guard ":" Block
| "case " _OptBlank Disjunction AsName Guard ":" Block

Guard
| " if" _OptBlank Expression

TypeAlias
| "type " _OptBlank Name _Eq Expression
| "type " _OptBlank Name "[" _InsideBlank TypeParameters _Eq Expression

TypeParameters@replaceWithChildren
| TypeParameter "]"
| TypeParameter "," _InsideBlank TypeParameters

TypeParameter
| Name
| Name Annotation
| Name Default
| "*" _OptBlank Name
| "**" _OptBlank Name

ExpressionStatement@flattenLists
| Expression
| Expression Assignments
| Expression AugmentedValue
| Expression Annotation
| Expression Annotation AssignedValue
| Expression "," _OptBlank TargetList

Assignments
| AssignedValue
| AssignedValue Assignments

AssignedValue@flattenLists
| _Eq Expression
| _Eq Expression "," _OptBlank ExpressionList

AugmentedValue
| _AugAssign Expression

TargetList
| Expression Assignments
| Expression "," _OptBlank TargetList
| Starred Assignments
| Starred "," _OptBlank TargetList

ExpressionList
| Expression
| Expression "," _OptBlank ExpressionList
| Starred
| Starred "," _OptBlank ExpressionList

# An identifier that starts with a standalone keyword ("passed",
# "return_value"); identifierStatement makes the statement an
# ExpressionStatement whose first child is this Name.
KeywordStatement@replaceWithChildren
| KeywordName
| KeywordName Trailers
| KeywordName Assignments
| KeywordName Trailers Assignments
| KeywordName AugmentedValue
| KeywordName Trailers AugmentedValue
| KeywordName Annotation
| KeywordName Annotation AssignedValue
| KeywordName "," _OptBlank TargetList

KeywordName@extendIdentifierStart
| letter _IdTail
| digit _IdTail
| "_" _IdTail

_Eq
