# Expressions
#
# An expression is a flat sequence: prefix operators, an operand with its
# trailers, then optionally a binary operator and the rest of the sequence.
# Every optional continuation is a shared prefix, so the generator factors it
# into a helper that allocates no node; only real operands, operators and
# trailers allocate. The resolveExpression hook nests each sequence as it
# reduces: BinaryOperation and UnaryOperation nodes take their operands as
# children, trailers take their object as first child, and Conditional and
# NamedExpression take their leading operand. A node's operator is the source
# text between its children.
#
# Disjunction is the same sequence without the conditional and walrus
# continuations, for positions Python restricts to a disjunction:
# comprehension iterables and conditions, conditional tests, lambda bodies,
# walrus values, yield operands and case patterns.

Expression@resolveExpression
| Name
| Name Trailers
| Name BinaryOperation Expression
| Name Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| Name Conditional
| Name Trailers Conditional
| Number
| Number Trailers
| Number BinaryOperation Expression
| Number Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| Number Conditional
| Number Trailers Conditional
| String
| String Trailers
| String BinaryOperation Expression
| String Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| String Conditional
| String Trailers Conditional
| Constant
| Constant Trailers
| Constant BinaryOperation Expression
| Constant Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| Constant Conditional
| Constant Trailers Conditional
| Parenthesized
| Parenthesized Trailers
| Parenthesized BinaryOperation Expression
| Parenthesized Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| Parenthesized Conditional
| Parenthesized Trailers Conditional
| List
| List Trailers
| List BinaryOperation Expression
| List Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| List Conditional
| List Trailers Conditional
| Brace
| Brace Trailers
| Brace BinaryOperation Expression
| Brace Trailers BinaryOperation Expression
| Brace Conditional
| Brace Trailers Conditional
| Name NamedExpression
| UnaryOperation Expression
| Lambda
| Yield

